          "title": "Dive Into AstroDB w/ Fred K Schott",
          "duration": "5:08:07",
          "channel": "Ryan Carniato",
          "description": "[]Astro is putting out new features at a staggering state. Amazing for a project that turns 3 years old this month. Let's catch up with Fred on what they've been working on, and where Astro is going into the future.\n\n[0:00] Intro\n[7:33] Questions with chat (part1 )\n\n[16:22] Welcome Fred\n[23:04] History of Astro\n[30:45] Astro 4.5\n[35:00] Astro Dev Portal\n[36:55] Astro DB\n[39:10] What is AstroDB?\n[42:00] Why make AstroDB\n[50:12] AstroDB Pricing\n[54:32] AstroDB deep dive\n[1:14:43] Coding time\n[2:11:50] Q&A with Fred\n\n[2:20:15] Questions with chat (part 2)\n[2:35:35] Tanner Linsley guest appearance\n[2:36:37] Tanner talks Tanstack Router and Tanstack Start\n[2:50:33] \"RSC's use streaming\"\n[2:53:32] Solid Start Beta (Single flight mutations)\n[2:54:30] Solid news\n\n[3:02:16] This Week in JavaScript\n[3:07:12] TWIJS: \"React's only secret\"\n[3:14:06] TWIJS: \"React is a marketing phenomenon\"\n\n[3:23:46] TWIJS: JS Frameworks throne\n[3:25:34] TWIJS: Trellix demo\n\n[3:33:48] Ryan Remix\n[3:34:20] JS benchmark is flawed\n[3:36:27] Discussion: Framework analysis\n[4:07:23] INP is here\n[4:15:00] Devin makes todo MVC\n[4:48:00] Closing remarks\n\nThanks to @boomshakalaka656 for the timestamps!",
